ns/guangdong/?kind=media\">All 1 items <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></a></div>\n  \n\n<article class=\"content-card region-card mini-card\" data-content-id=\"prism-audio\">\n  \n  <div class=\"card-copy\"><div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Dialect in media · 有声作品</span><span>Guangdong</span><span>Work introduction</span><span class=\"sample-label\">Synthetic example</span></div>\n  <h4><a data-title href=\"/xiangyin-preview/en/content/prism-audio/?from=%2Fxiangyin-preview%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dguangdong%23region-panel\">慢慢听，一段地方故事</a></h4>\n  <p data-summary>有声作品介绍；本条没有真实音频。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" data-link href=\"/xiangyin-preview/en/content/prism-audio/?from=%2Fxiangyin-preview%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dguangdong%23region-panel\">Explore the work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n</article>\n\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"region-group\" data-region-group=\"related\" aria-labelledby=\"panel-group-related\">\n  <div class=\"group-heading\"><h3 id=\"panel-group-related\">Research and resources</h3><a href=\"/xiangyin-preview/en/regions/guangdong/?kind=related\">All 1 items <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></a></div>\n  \n\n<article class=\"content-card region-card mini-card\" data-content-id=\"prism-recording\">\n  \n  <div class=\"card-copy\"><div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Language protection</span><span>Synthetic demonstration</span><span>Guangdong</span><span class=\"sample-label\">Synthetic example</span></div>\n  <h4><a data-title href=\"/xiangyin-preview/en/content/prism-recording/?from=%2Fxiangyin-preview%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dguangdong%23region-panel\">把地方声音留下来</a></h4>\n  <p data-summary>语言记录与传承资料的合成介绍。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" data-link href=\"/xiangyin-preview/en/content/prism-recording/?from=%2Fxiangyin-preview%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dguangdong%23region-panel\">Read about this material <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n</article>\n\n</section>\n\n\n"
